# The district's public Google Calendar, in iCal format. The calendar page
# reads it on the server and refreshes hourly; without it the page shows the
# events recorded in lib/events.ts with a "Live calendar to come" note.
#
# Google Calendar → Settings → (the district calendar) → Integrate calendar →
# "Public address in iCal format". The calendar must be set to public.
